        "content": ". Eliminate (C) and (D) because they are positive, and then check (A) and (B) on a calculator. The decimal form of (A) is –2.5; keep (A). The decimal form of (B) is –0.4; eliminate (B), which makes (A) correct.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
