    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The question asks for the number of points of intersection in a system of equations. One method is enter both equations into the built-in calculator, then scroll and zoom as needed to see where, if at all, they intersect. The lines are parallel and do not intersect, which means (D) is correct.",
