    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The question asks for the solution to a system of equations. One method is to enter both equations into the built-in graphing calculator, then scroll and zoom as needed to find the point(s) of intersection. The graph shows one point of intersection at",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
