      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "(–18, –6), which is (B).",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Another approach is to plug in the answers. Rewrite the answer choices on the scratch paper and label them “(",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "x",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
