        "content": "has exactly one solution",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". To determine the number of solutions to a quadratic, use the discriminant. The discriminant is the part of the quadratic formula under the square root sign, and it can be written as",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
