  {
    "url": "https://oneprep.xyz/question/3435/?question_set=princeton-review-practice-tests-question-bank&module=math&primary_class=Algebra&skill=Functions",
    "question_set": "princeton-review-practice-tests-question-bank",
    "subject": "Math",
    "difficulty": "",
    "domain": "Algebra",
    "skill": "Functions",
    "question_type": "select",
    "question_content": [
      {
        "type": "table",
        "content": "<table border=\"1\" height=\"170\" style=\"height: 170px; width: 52.1959%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 37px;\">Time<br/>(hours)</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 37px;\">Number of bacteria</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 17px;\">0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 17px;\">1,000,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">100,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">10,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">6</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">1,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">10</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 18px;\">10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The table shows the estimated number of bacteria in a laboratory culture over a span of 10 hours. What type of function best models the relationship between the number of bacteria and time?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The question asks for a description of a function that models a specific situation. Compare the answer choices. Two choices say the function is increasing, and two say it is decreasing. The values in the table for the number of bacteria get smaller as the values for time get bigger, so the function is decreasing. Eliminate (C) and (D) because they describe an increasing function. The difference between (A) and (B) is whether the function is linear or exponential. Determine this by testing pairs of values from the table. When the time increases by 2 hours from 0 to 2, the number of bacteria decreases by 1,000,000 – 100,000 = 900,000. When the time increases by 2 hours from 2 to 4, the number of bacteria decreases by 100,000 – 10,000 = 90,000. The value decreased by 900,000 during the first 2 hours and by 90,000 during the next 2 hours. A linear function would change by the same amount over each interval, so eliminate (B). The relationship between the number of bacteria and time is exponential. The correct answer is (A).",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      }
    ],
    "answer": {
      "identifier": "A",
      "is_correct": true,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "string",
          "content": "Decreasing exponential",
          "metadata": {
            "style": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "identifier": "A",
        "is_correct": true,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "Decreasing exponential",
            "metadata": {
              "style": []
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "identifier": "B",
        "is_correct": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "Decreasing linear",
            "metadata": {
              "style": []
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "identifier": "C",
        "is_correct": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "Increasing exponential",
            "metadata": {
              "style": []
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "identifier": "D",
        "is_correct": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "Increasing linear",
            "metadata": {
              "style": []
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "question_id": "3435",
    "knowledge_point": "None"
