          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "In a certain video game, players can make combinations of cards that are worth different numbers of coins depending on the number of cards the combination contains. One player earned a total of 500 coins by making",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
