        "type": "string",
        "content": "T",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "three-card combinations. If the given equation represents this game situation, how many fewer coins is a three-card combination worth than a four-card combination?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "blank"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The question asks for a value given a specific situation. Translate the information in Bite-Sized Pieces. The question states that the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "player earned a total of 500 coins",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Since the sum of 22",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "F",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and 12",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "T",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "is the number of coins, and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "F",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "T",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "are the numbers of four-card and three-card combinations, respectively, 22 and 12 must be the coin values of one",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "F",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "combination and one",
        "metadata": {
