    "question_content": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Banerji currently owns 6,500 baseball cards. He is gradually selling his collection and estimates that the number of cards he owns will decrease by 20 percent every 6 months. Which of the following functions best models Banerji’s estimate of the number of baseball cards,",
