        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", he will own m months from now?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The question asks for an equation that represents a specific situation. The number of baseball cards in the collection is decreasing by a certain percent over time, so this question is about exponential decay. Write down the growth and decay formula, which is",
