    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The question asks for the number of solutions to a quadratic equation. One method is to use the built-in graphing calculator. Enter the equation without the “= 0” part to see a parabola, and then scroll and zoom to see how many times, if any, the parabola intersects the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
