          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "= 20, there is one vertical line, so the equation has one real solution; eliminate (C). When",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "c",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "= 25, there are no vertical lines, so there are no real solutions. It is also possible to delete the “0 =” portion of the equation to see a parabola. The parabola opens upward and has a vertex above the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
