      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "b",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Eliminate (B) and (D) because they do not contain these terms. When (A) is expanded, it includes those two terms but also includes 6",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "a",
        "metadata": {
