        "type": "string",
        "content": "b",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "is multiplied by the number of square feet in the seating area, it must represent a value per square foot, not a total value. Keep (C) because it is consistent with this information, but eliminate (D) because it refers to a total number. The answer is (C).",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      }
    ],
    "answer": {
