    "question_type": "select",
    "question_content": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Samantha saved a total of $320 to buy a prom dress. She first saved a gift of $75 that she received from her grandparents, and then saved $5 dollars a day for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "d",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "days. Which of the following equations represents this situation?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The question asks for an equation that represents a specific situation. Translate the information in Bite-Sized Pieces and eliminate after each piece. One piece of information says that Samantha",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "saved $5 dollars a day for d days",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Since",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "d",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "represents the number of days, it should be multiplied by 5. Eliminate (C) and (D) because they multiply",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "d",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "by 75 instead of by 5. Compare the remaining answer choices. The difference between (A) and (B) is whether 75 is added to 5",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "d",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "or subtracted from 5",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "d",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Since Samantha",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "first saved a gift of $75",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and went on to save a total of $320, 75 should be added to 5",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "d",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and set equal to 320. Eliminate (A) because it uses subtraction. The correct answer is (B).",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "answer": {
      "identifier": "B",
      "is_correct": true,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "string",
          "content": "5",
          "metadata": {
            "style": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "content": "d",
          "metadata": {
            "style": [
              "em"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "content": "+ 75 = 320",
          "metadata": {
            "style": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "options": [
