        "content": "represents the number of years between the given time and the time the tree was planted, 2 must represent the average number of feet the tree grew each year.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice A is incorrect and may result from interpreting the coefficient 2 as doubling instead of as increasing by 2 each year. Choice C is incorrect. The height of the tree when it was 1 year old was",
        "metadata": {
