        "content": "centimeters. The plant was 36.8 centimeters tall after 12 days, so at the beginning of the study its height was",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "content": {
          "type": "base64",
          "content": "data:image/png;base64,",
