        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "6"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "ounces of wax remaining after a period of time has passed. The amount of wax the candle has lost during the time period can be found by subtracting the remaining amount of wax from the amount of wax the candle was made of, which yields",
