.46875 \nQ 45.015625 34.46875 43.40625 35.984375 \nQ 41.796875 37.5 40.4375 37.5 \nQ 39.265625 37.5 37.796875 34.96875 \nL 30.46875 22.46875 \nL 34.671875 8.6875 \nQ 35.640625 5.375 37.3125 5.375 \nQ 38.765625 5.375 40.421875 6.890625 \nQ 42.09375 8.40625 42.78125 9.671875 \nQ 43.171875 9.671875 43.75 8.890625 \nQ 44.34375 8.109375 44.34375 7.71875 \nQ 44.046875 6.0625 40.71875 2.78125 \nQ 37.40625 -0.484375 34.375 -0.484375 \nQ 30.28125 -0.484375 27.734375 8.015625 \nL 25.484375 15.625 \nL 19.34375 4.984375 \nQ 16.109375 -0.59375 11.140625 -0.59375 \nQ 7.8125 -0.59375 5.46875 1.375 \nQ 4.6875 2.734375 4.6875 3.90625 \nQ 4.6875 5.375 5.703125 6.390625 \nQ 6.734375 7.421875 7.8125 7.421875 \nQ 9.078125 7.421875 10.6875 5.90625 \nQ 12.3125 4.390625 13.671875 4.390625 \nQ 14.84375 4.390625 16.3125 6.9375 \nL 24.03125 20.21875 \nL 20.015625 33.296875 \nQ 19.046875 36.625 17.390625 36.625 \nQ 15.921875 36.625 14.25 35.109375 \nQ 12.59375 33.59375 11.921875 32.328125 \nQ 11.53125 32.328125 10.9375 33.109375 \nQ 10.359375 33.890625 10.359375 34.28125 \nQ 10.640625 35.9375 13.953125 39.203125 \nQ 17.28125 42.484375 20.3125 42.484375 \nz\n\" id=\"CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g transform=\"translate(277.443926 244.798528)scale(0.15 -0.15)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"line2d_1\">\n<path clip-path=\"url(#p184f4ddf74)\" d=\"M 63.03256 241.503216 \nL 192.310818 34.658003 \nL 192.310818 34.658003 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clippath id=\"p184f4ddf74\">\n<rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"270.55209\" x=\"22.675986\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n</clippath>\n</defs>\n</svg>\n<div aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a line\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"region\"><ul>\n<li>The line slants sharply up from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma 0)</li>\n<li>(2 comma 80)</li>\n<li>(4 comma 160)</li>\n<li>(6 comma 240)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure>",
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "According to the graph, what is the estimated number of candy bars the machine wraps with a label per second?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice B is correct. For the graph shown, the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "x",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-axis represents time, in seconds, and the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "y",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-axis represents the number of candy bars wrapped. The slope of a line in the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "xy",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-plane is the change in",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "y"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for each",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "1"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-unit increase in",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". It follows that the slope of the graph shown represents the estimated number of candy bars the machine wraps with a label per second. The slope,",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", of a line in the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "xy",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-plane can be found using any two points,",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{1} , y_{1}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{2} , y_{2}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", on the line and the slope formula",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{y_{2} - y_{1}}{x_{2} - x_{1}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". The graph shown passes through the points",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(0 , 0\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(2 , 80\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Substituting these points for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{1} , y_{1}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{2} , y_{2}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", respectively, in the slope formula yields",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{80 - 0}{2 - 0}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", which is equivalent to",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{80}{2}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", or",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = 40"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Therefore, the estimated number of candy bars the machine wraps with a label per second is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "40"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ".",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
