        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "f \\left(h\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", in dollars. It follows that the relationship can be represented by an equation of the form",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "f \\left(h\\right) = m h + b"
