      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The graph represents the total charge, in dollars, by an electrician for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "hours of work. The electrician charges a onetime fee plus an hourly rate. What is the best interpretation of the slope of the graph?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice A is correct. It’s given that the electrician charges a onetime fee plus an hourly rate. It's also given that the graph represents the total charge, in dollars, for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "hours of work. This graph shows a linear relationship in the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "xy",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-plane. Thus, the total charge",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "y"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", in dollars, for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "hours of work can be represented as",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "y = m x + b"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", where",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "is the slope and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(0 , b\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "is the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "y",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-intercept of the graph of the equation in the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "xy",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-plane. Since the given graph represents the total charge, in dollars, by an electrician for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "hours of work, it follows that its slope is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", or the electrician’s hourly rate.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice B is incorrect. The electrician's onetime fee is represented by the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "y",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-coordinate of the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "y",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-intercept, not the slope, of the graph.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "answer": {
      "identifier": "A",
      "is_correct": true,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "string",
          "content": "The electrician’s hourly rate",
          "metadata": {
            "style": [
              "p"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "identifier": "A",
        "is_correct": true,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "The electrician’s hourly rate",
            "metadata": {
              "style": [
                "p"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "identifier": "B",
        "is_correct": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "The electrician’s onetime fee",
            "metadata": {
              "style": [
                "p"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "identifier": "C",
        "is_correct": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "The maximum amount that the electrician charges",
            "metadata": {
              "style": [
                "p"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "identifier": "D",
        "is_correct": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "content": "The total amount that the electrician charges",
            "metadata": {
              "style": [
                "p"
