    "question_content": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The pressure exerted on a scuba diver at sea level is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "14.70 \\text{pounds} \\text{per} \\text{square} \\text{inch} \\left(\\text{psi}\\right)"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". For each foot the scuba diver descends below sea level, the pressure exerted on the scuba diver increases by",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.44 \\text{psi}"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". What is the total pressure, in",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\text{psi}"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", exerted on the scuba diver at",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "105"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "feet below sea level?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice A is correct. It's given that the pressure exerted on a scuba diver at sea level is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "14.70 \\text{pounds}\\textrm{ }\\text{per}\\textrm{ }\\text{square}\\textrm{ }\\text{inch} \\left(\\text{psi}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". It's also given that for each foot the scuba diver descends below sea level, the pressure exerted on the scuba diver increases by",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.44 \\text{psi}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". The total pressure, in",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\text{psi}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", exerted on the scuba diver at",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "feet below sea level can be represented by the expression",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.44 x + 14.70"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Substituting",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "105"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "in this expression yields",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.44 \\left(\\right. 105 \\left.\\right) + 14.70"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", or",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "60.90"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Therefore, the total pressure exerted on the scuba diver at",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "105"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "feet below sea level is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "60.90 \\text{psi}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ".",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice C is incorrect. This is the pressure, in",
        "metadata": {
