e\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"region\"><ul>\n<li>The line slants gradually down from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:\n<ul>\n<li>(negative 8 comma 0)</li>\n<li>(0 comma negative 8) </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure>",
