    "question_content": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "A movie theater sells two types of tickets, adult tickets for $12 and child tickets for $8. If the theater sold 30 tickets for a total of $300, how much, in dollars, was spent on adult tickets? (Disregard the $ sign when gridding your answer.)",
