    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice C is correct. It's given that the system has infinitely many solutions. A system of two linear equations has infinitely many solutions when the two linear equations are equivalent. Dividing both sides of the given equation by",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
