7.984375 42.484375 42.96875 42.484375 \nQ 46.296875 42.484375 48.640625 40.53125 \nQ 49.421875 38.96875 49.421875 37.984375 \nQ 49.421875 36.53125 48.390625 35.5 \nQ 47.359375 34.46875 46.296875 34.46875 \nQ 45.015625 34.46875 43.40625 35.984375 \nQ 41.796875 37.5 40.4375 37.5 \nQ 39.265625 37.5 37.796875 34.96875 \nL 30.46875 22.46875 \nL 34.671875 8.6875 \nQ 35.640625 5.375 37.3125 5.375 \nQ 38.765625 5.375 40.421875 6.890625 \nQ 42.09375 8.40625 42.78125 9.671875 \nQ 43.171875 9.671875 43.75 8.890625 \nQ 44.34375 8.109375 44.34375 7.71875 \nQ 44.046875 6.0625 40.71875 2.78125 \nQ 37.40625 -0.484375 34.375 -0.484375 \nQ 30.28125 -0.484375 27.734375 8.015625 \nL 25.484375 15.625 \nL 19.34375 4.984375 \nQ 16.109375 -0.59375 11.140625 -0.59375 \nQ 7.8125 -0.59375 5.46875 1.375 \nQ 4.6875 2.734375 4.6875 3.90625 \nQ 4.6875 5.375 5.703125 6.390625 \nQ 6.734375 7.421875 7.8125 7.421875 \nQ 9.078125 7.421875 10.6875 5.90625 \nQ 12.3125 4.390625 13.671875 4.390625 \nQ 14.84375 4.390625 16.3125 6.9375 \nL 24.03125 20.21875 \nL 20.015625 33.296875 \nQ 19.046875 36.625 17.390625 36.625 \nQ 15.921875 36.625 14.25 35.109375 \nQ 12.59375 33.59375 11.921875 32.328125 \nQ 11.53125 32.328125 10.9375 33.109375 \nQ 10.359375 33.890625 10.359375 34.28125 \nQ 10.640625 35.9375 13.953125 39.203125 \nQ 17.28125 42.484375 20.3125 42.484375 \nz\n\" id=\"CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g transform=\"translate(260.389509 218.193084)scale(0.15 -0.15)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"line2d_1\">\n<path clip-path=\"url(#pb728e4265d)\" d=\"M 37.782876 75.010402 \nL 247.61393 242.875245 \nL 247.61393 242.875245 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n</g>\n<g id=\"line2d_2\">\n<path clip-path=\"url(#pb728e4265d)\" d=\"M 37.782876 144.954087 \nL 247.61393 228.886508 \nL 247.61393 228.886508 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clippath id=\"pb728e4265d\">\n<rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"268.898496\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n</clippath>\n</defs>\n</svg>\n<div aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a system of 2 lines\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"region\"><ul><li>For the first line in the system:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>The line slants gradually down from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>(3 comma 2)</li>\n<li>(8 comma 0)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For the second line in the system:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>The line slants gradually down from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>(3 comma 4)</li>\n<li>(8 comma 0)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure>",
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "What system of linear equations is represented by the lines shown?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice D is correct. A line in the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "xy",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-plane that passes through the points",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{1} , y_{1}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{2} , y_{2}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "has slope",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", where",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{y_{2} - y_{1}}{x_{2} - x_{1}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", and can be defined by an equation of the form",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "y - y_{1} = m \\left(x - x_{1}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". One of the lines shown in the graph passes through the points",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(8 , 0\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(3 , 4\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Substituting",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "8"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x_{1}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ",",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "y_{1}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ",",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "3"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x_{2}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "4"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "y_{2}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "in the equation",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{y_{2} - y_{1}}{x_{2} - x_{1}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "yields",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{4 - 0}{3 - 8}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", or",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = - \\frac{4}{5}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Substituting",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "- \\frac{4}{5}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ",",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "8"
        }
      },
      {
