<g id=\"line2d_2\">\n<path clip-path=\"url(#p5cca09d95d)\" d=\"M 41.860197 221.280692 \nL 228.685516 34.455372 \nL 228.685516 34.455372 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clippath id=\"p5cca09d95d\">\n<rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"262.488358\" x=\"9.200821\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n</clippath>\n</defs>\n</svg>\n<div aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a system of 2 lines\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"region\"><ul><li>For the first line in the system:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>The line slants sharply down from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma 8)</li>\n<li>(3 comma 4)</li>\n<li>(5 comma four thirds)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For the second line in the system:\n<ul>\n<li>The line slants gradually up from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma 1)</li>\n<li>(3 comma 4)</li>\n<li>(5 comma 6)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure>",
