            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice C is correct. It’s given that",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "represents the original price, in dollars, of the mirror, and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "v"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "represents the original price, in dollars, of the vase. It's also given that the combined original price for the mirror and the vase is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\$ 60"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". This can be represented by the equation",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m + v = 60"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". After a",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "25 \\%"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "discount to the mirror is applied, the sale price of the mirror is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "75 \\%"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "of its original price. This can be represented by the expression",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.75 m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". After a",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "45 \\%"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "discount to the vase is applied, the sale price of the vase is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "55 \\%"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "of its original price. This can be represented by the expression",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.55 v"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". It’s given that the combined sale price for the two items is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\$ 39"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". This can be represented by the equation",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.75 m + 0.55 v = 39"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Therefore, the system of equations consisting of the equations",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m + v = 60"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "0.75 m + 0.55 v = 39"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "gives the original price",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", in dollars, of the mirror and the original price",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "v"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", in dollars, of the vase.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice A is incorrect. The second equation in this system of equations represents a",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
