      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "4"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". A solution to a system of equations must satisfy each equation in the system. It follows that if",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x , y\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "is a solution to the system, the point",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x , y\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "lies on the graph in the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "xy",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-plane of each equation in the system. According to the graph, the point",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x , y\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "that lies on the graph of each equation in the system is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(4 , 1\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Therefore, the solution to the system is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(4 , 1\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". It follows that the value of",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "x"
        }
