        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice A is correct. The number of containers in a shipment must have a weight less than or equal to 300 pounds. The total weight, in pounds, of detergent and fabric softener that the supplier delivers can be expressed as the weight of each container multiplied by the number of each type of container, which is 7.35",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "d",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for detergent and 6.2",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "s",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for fabric softener. Since this total cannot exceed 300 pounds, it follows that",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
