        "type": "string",
        "content": "candles. Therefore,",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "s + \\mathcal{l} \\geq 200"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". The inequalities",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "4.90 s + 11.60 \\mathcal{l} \\leq 2,200"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "s + \\mathcal{l} \\geq 200"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "can be combined into one compound inequality by rewriting the second inequality so that its left-hand side is equivalent to the left-hand side of the first inequality. Subtracting",
