        }
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "content": {
          "type": "base64",
          "content": "data:image/png;base64,",
          "style": [
            ""
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Therefore, the least number of hours Ken must work the rest of the week to save at least $270 for the week is 22.",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choices A and B are incorrect because Ken can save $270 by working fewer hours than 38 or 33 for the rest of the week. Choice D is incorrect. If Ken worked 16 hours for the rest of the week, his total earnings for the week will be",
