        "type": "string",
        "content": ", the number of years after installation at which the total amount of energy cost savings will exceed the installation cost?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice B is correct. The savings each year from installing the geothermal heating system will be the average annual energy cost for the home before the geothermal heating system installation minus the average annual energy cost after the geothermal heating system installation, which is",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
