style=\"stroke:#808080;stroke-opacity:0.5;\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g clip-path=\"url(#p12cc54c841)\">\n<use style=\"fill:#808080;fill-opacity:0.5;stroke:#808080;stroke-opacity:0.5;\" x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#m227f92367f\" y=\"275.22\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"line2d_1\">\n<path clip-path=\"url(#p12cc54c841)\" d=\"M 30.021408 240.543789 \nL 239.852462 100.65642 \nL 239.852462 100.65642 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clippath id=\"p12cc54c841\">\n<rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"254.472611\" x=\"13.208695\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n</clippath>\n</defs>\n</svg>\n<div aria-label=\"Long description for graph of an inequality\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"region\"><ul><li>The boundary of the inequality is a solid line.\n<ul>\n<li>The line slants gradually up from left to right.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma negative 6)</li>\n<li>(9 comma 0)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>The area above and to the left of the boundary is shaded.</li>\n</ul></div></figure>",
        "metadata": {
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "The shaded region shown represents the solutions to which inequality?",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "p"
          ],
          "content_type": "stem"
        }
      }
    ],
    "explanation": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "Choice A is correct. The equation for the line representing the boundary of the shaded region can be written in slope-intercept form",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "y = m x + b"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", where",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "is the slope and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(0 , b\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "is the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "y",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-intercept of the line. For the graph shown, the boundary line passes through the points",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(0 , - 6\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(9 , 0\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Given two points on a line,",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{1} , y_{1}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{2} , y_{2}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", the slope of the line can be calculated using the equation",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{y_{2} - y_{1}}{x_{2} - x_{1}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Substituting the points",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(0 , - 6\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(9 , 0\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "for",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{1} , y_{1}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "and",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(x_{2} , y_{2}\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", respectively, in this equation yields",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{0 - \\left(- 6\\right)}{9 - 0}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", which is equivalent to",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{6}{9}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ", or",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "m = \\frac{2}{3}"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": ". Since the point",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
          "content": "\\left(0 , - 6\\right)"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "represents the",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "y",
        "metadata": {
          "style": [
            "em"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "content": "-intercept, it follows that",
        "metadata": {
          "style": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formula",
        "content": {
          "type": "latex",
